# Error
## if rules not match show red error item to fix it
Show
    CustomAlertSound "homm3snd/DANGER.wav"
    MinimapIcon 0 Red Star
    PlayEffect Red
    SetBorderColor 255 0 0 255
    SetBackgroundColor 255 255 255 255
    SetTextColor 255 0 0 255
    SetFontSize 45
